s, bad items, strict orders, cancelled orders and every coupon and country.\n\n| Function | What it does |\n|---|---|\n| `_price_items` | Sums the item subtotal, tracks SKU units and records bad-item problems in the original order. |\n| `_discount` | Applies the coupon rules. |\n| `_shipping` | Applies the free-shipping threshold and the US versus non-US rates. |\n| `_order_total` | Combines discount, tax, shipping and rounding. |\n| `_record_customer` | Updates the per-customer order count and spend. |\n| `_top_sku` | Picks the SKU with the most units, breaking ties by SKU string. |\n| `_best_customer` | Picks the first customer with the highest spend. |\n\nEvery function is well under 30 lines. As in the original, SKU units from valid items still count even when a strict order is later skipped.","ttft_ms":1945,"type":"result","duration_ms":23661,"uuid":"8163f3fc-74ce-457d-9976-d0929a728b8f","ttft_stream_ms":1140,"time_to_request_ms":62,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":17,"system_prompt":7,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":11,"input_hooks":0,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":2,"engine_pickup":1,"autocompact":1,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":10,"message_normalization":1,"client_creation":4,"request_build":4},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":11,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":69,"time_to_request_major_faults":177,"first_content_frame_ms":1140,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
